  "id": "USN-9153-1",
  "summary": "cloud-init vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that cloud-init incorrectly handled certain errors when\nconfiguring user passwords on systems with SSSD installed but not\nconfigured. An attacker could possibly use this issue to access affected\nuser accounts without a password, resulting in unauthorized access.",
